<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>ossai75.ng</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:#4A148C;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:sans-serif;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4A148C,#7B1FA2)}
.main{width:100%;text-align:center;padding:90px 0}
.logo-big{width:650px;height:650px;max-width:92vw;max-height:92vw;background:white;border-radius:75px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 25px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}
.logo-big img{width:92%;height:92%;object-fit:contain}
h1{font-size:72px;font-weight:900;color:white;margin:22px 0 6px;letter-spacing:1px}
.sub{font-size:34px;font-weight:900;color:white;margin-bottom:28px}
.btn{width:92%;max-width:480px;padding:28px;border-radius:60px;border:none;font-size:34px;font-weight:900;margin:12px auto;display:block}
.white{background:white;color:#6A1B9A}
.outline{border:4px solid white;color:white;background:transparent}
.top,.bot{position:fixed;left:0;width:100%;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;z-index:99}
.top{top:0;padding:22px 0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.22)}
.bot{bottom:0;padding:22px 0;background:rgba(0,0,0,0.5)}
.top b,.bot b{font-size:36px;font-weight:900;color:white;display:inline-block;animation:slide 40s linear infinite}
@keyframes slide{from{transform:translateX(100vw)}to{transform:translateX(-100%)}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="top"><b>🔥 OSSAI75.NG ★ PREGNANT MOTHERS CARE ★ MAMACOIN 2000PTS = ₦7000 ★ BABYCOIN LOCKED ★ CHEERSCOIN BONUS AFTER 3 YEARS ★ 🔥</b></div>
<div class="main">
<div class="logo-big"><img src="icon.png"></div>
<h1>ossai75.ng</h1>
<div class="sub">Pregnant Mothers Care App</div>
<button class="btn white">Create Account</button>
<button class="btn outline">Login</button>
</div>
<div class="bot"><b>💜 WATCH ADS 6 ADS = 1 POINT ★ VERIFIED 3 ADS = 1 POINT ★ MAX 10 MAMACOINS ★ 4 QUOTES = 10 ADS 💜</b></div>
</body>
</html>
